# Show metadata APIs (at least one recommended, both optional)
# Get TVDB API key: https://thetvdb.com/dashboard/account/apikey
# Non-empty values initialize missing or empty settings when the server starts.
# Existing settings take precedence. Restart after changing this file.
# Project API keys work without a PIN; subscriber keys can use an optional PIN.
TVDB_API_KEY=""
TVDB_PIN=""
# Get TMDB API key: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api (free)
TMDB_API_KEY=""
